Vibedillo TODO List
====================

High Priority:
-------------
1. **CSS :hover pseudo-class support** - Currently not implemented
   - CSS parser recognizes :hover but drops the rule with debug message
   - Need to implement pseudo-class matching in selector logic
   - Need to track hover state per element and trigger style recalculation
   - Need to integrate with mouse event handlers (enter/leave/motion)

2. **CSS :active pseudo-class support** - Not implemented
   - Similar to :hover but for active/pressed state

3. **CSS :focus pseudo-class support** - Not implemented
   - For form elements and links

4. **CSS :visited/:link pseudo-classes** - Partially implemented
   - Currently only :link and :visited are recognized
   - Need proper visited link tracking

Medium Priority:
---------------
5. **CSS :focus-visible pseudo-class** - For keyboard navigation accessibility
6. **CSS :checked pseudo-class** - For checkboxes/radio buttons
7. **CSS :disabled/:enabled pseudo-classes** - For form elements
8. **CSS :valid/:invalid pseudo-classes** - For form validation

Low Priority:
------------
9. **CSS :first-child/:last-child/:nth-child** pseudo-classes
10. **CSS :not() pseudo-class** - Selector negation
11. **CSS ::selection pseudo-element** - Text selection styling
11. **CSS ::placeholder pseudo-element** - Input placeholder styling
12. **CSS ::marker pseudo-element** - List item markers
12. **CSS ::file-selector-button** - File input button styling

Ongoing:
-------
- Image relative positioning offset application (allocation not being applied to visual rendering)
- Negative percentage parsing for relative positioning (right: -30%, bottom: -30%)
- Image widget allocation not applying relative offsets to visual rendering
- CSS parser property indexing issue (alphabetical sort vs enum values)

